# PayAlert — local configuration template
#
# PayAlert needs NO credentials to build or run. Detection, transaction history, the
# cashbook, reminders, the payment QR, export and backup all work entirely on-device,
# with no account and no network access. There is also no monetization of any kind.
#
# Copy to `.env` only if you are working on the OPTIONAL cloud sync path described in
# supabase/schema.sql; the app itself never reads that file.
#
# Never commit real credentials. `.env` is git-ignored.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional: cloud sync (not used by the shipped app)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PayAlert is local-first and ships without any Supabase client, dependency or
# sync code. The schema in supabase/schema.sql exists only as a starting point for a
# future optional sync feature. If you build one, use the publishable key — never the
# service_role secret.
#
# SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
# SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=sb_publishable_your_key_here

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional: build overrides
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# APP_DISPLAY_NAME=PayAlert
